From bdb71e6fb0bfc156a9e4673ae8cc41fa48ace13a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zed-patches <zed-patches@localhost>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 14:26:25 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] agent_ui: the plan card's minimize sits on the right, before
 its close
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Zeo next proposal §6.41 (ask 65, 2026-11-16). The plan card's header drew
its Disclosure first, then the title, then the × ("Clear Plan"). The
disclosure now follows the title, right before the ×, as a window's title
bar has minimize then close. The question card (0082) and the tasks card
(0080, 0092) already end their headers that way, so only this header
changes; the whole row still toggles the plan, as before.

Carried to Zed 96362135 (zeo-0.14.0_p20261118): upstream now draws the
disclosure for every plan (a plan file no longer hides it) and adds an
"Open Plan File" button after the title when the plan has a path. The
order is title, Open Plan File, minimize, close -- the two window controls
stay last.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---

diff --git a/crates/agent_ui/src/conversation_view/thread_view.rs b/crates/agent_ui/src/conversation_view/thread_view.rs
index 5f57860..41a2301 100644
--- a/crates/agent_ui/src/conversation_view/thread_view.rs
+++ b/crates/agent_ui/src/conversation_view/thread_view.rs
@@ -5393,7 +5393,6 @@ impl ThreadView {
             .when(plan_expanded, |this| {
                 this.border_b_1().border_color(cx.theme().colors().border)
             })
-            .child(Disclosure::new("plan_disclosure", plan_expanded))
             .child(title.flex_1())
             .when_some(plan_path, |this, path| {
                 this.child(
@@ -5407,6 +5406,9 @@ impl ThreadView {
                         })),
                 )
             })
+            // Zeo next §6.41 (ask 65): minimize then close at the right edge, as a window's
+            // title bar has them, instead of the disclosure leading the title.
+            .child(Disclosure::new("plan_disclosure", plan_expanded))
             .child(
                 IconButton::new("dismiss-plan", IconName::Close)
                     .icon_size(IconSize::XSmall)
